    <div style="color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.8;"><h2 style="color:var(--color-text);margin:2rem 0 1rem;">1. Information We Collect</h2><p>AlphaFlux ("we," "our," or "us") collects information you provide directly, such as your name, email address, company name, and any messages you send through our contact forms. We also collect analytics data through Google Analytics 4 about how visitors interact with our website.</p><h2 style="color:var(--color-text);margin:2rem 0 1rem;">2. How We Use Your Information</h2><p>We use the information we collect to respond to your inquiries, provide our services, improve our website, and send marketing communications if you have opted in.</p><h2 style="color:var(--color-text);margin:2rem 0 1rem;">3. Data Sharing</h2><p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share data with service providers such as FormSubmit (form processing) and Google (analytics) solely to operate our website and deliver our services.</p><h2 style="color:var(--color-text);margin:2rem 0 1rem;">4. Cookies</h2><p>We use cookies for Google Analytics and essential site functionality. You can disable cookies in your browser settings.</p><h2 style="color:var(--color-text);margin:2rem 0 1rem;">5. Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@alphaflux.net" style="color:var(--color-primary-light);">hello@alphaflux.net</a>.</p></div>
